{"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"level":2,"text":"Overview","type":"heading","anchor":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Bali is rich in culture and one of them is ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"patung","type":"text"}]},{"text":" (English: statue). Arca provides comprehensive statue information spread throughout Bali, allowing you to explore the way you want - super simple and convenient!","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Discover Bali’s cultural heritage through an interactive, audio-guided experience that brings the stories of ancient statues to life. Whether you’re a tourist exploring for the first time or a local wanting to learn more about your cultural heritage, Arca makes statue discovery accessible and engaging."}]},{"level":2,"text":"Key Features","type":"heading","anchor":"Key-Features"},{"level":3,"text":"Self-Guided Audio Tour","type":"heading","anchor":"Self-Guided-Audio-Tour"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Arca provides an interactive audio-based tour guide for "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"patung","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" nearby. With just one click, tour mode is activated for you. The audio tour even works while you listen to music - Arca speaks the information about the "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"patung"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" you pass on the road."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[]},{"level":3,"text":"Detailed Patung Information","type":"heading","anchor":"Detailed-Patung-Information"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Curious about the story and history behind a ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"patung"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":"? Arca provides comprehensive statue information including:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Name and cultural significance"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Physical dimensions and materials","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Construction year and historical context","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Sculptor information and artistic details","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Stories and legends associated with each statue","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"inlineContent":[],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":3,"text":"Awareness Pocket Guide","anchor":"Awareness-Pocket-Guide","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"Patung","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" in Bali are not just monuments - they are integral parts of Balinese rituals and spiritual life. Arca categorizes statues into:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Ritual Category","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Sacred statues used in ceremonies and religious practices"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Monumental Category"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": Historical and cultural landmarks"}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"inlineContent":[],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":3,"text":"Bookmark Your Patung","anchor":"Bookmark-Your-Patung","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Save statues that resonate with you or hold emotional significance. Create your personal collection for easy access and future visits."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"topicSections":[{"abstract":[{"text":"Get up and running with Arca for exploring Bali’s cultural heritage.","type":"text"}],"identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.tudemaha.arca\/documentation\/Arca\/GettingS